To call `ippl::initialize` and `ippl::finalize` in a main program, you should follow the pattern typically used in initialization routines of the library.

Based on the source code (e.g., see `data/raw/ippl/doc/examples/HelloWorld.hpp`), these functions are called at the beginning and end of the application's execution to set up and tear down the necessary environments or resources.

**Example Usage:**
